    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Founded in London in 2009 as DesignStudio; rebranded to Further in September 2025 after acquiring motion studio Analog and experience studio Pixel Artworks. Three offices: London (HQ), New York, Dubai; LinkedIn shows ~407 employees, firmly 100+. Known for large-scale identity and brand programmes: Airbnb, Deliveroo, Premier League, Eurostar, EA Sports, UFC, Xbox. Capabilities span brand strategy, identity systems, campaign, digital, experience, and production. Scale and positioning read as full-service Agency rather than boutique Studio. The entry Website and Name reflect the DesignStudio era; the live domain is now further.group and the Instagram handle is @further_agency. Country corrected from Australia (migration error) to UK, US, UAE. Capabilities field is jonathan-set at Graphic design; expanded tags proposed in Open Questions.",
